er 1 to the next place value (hundred-million place).\n\n10. **Add the digits in the hundred-million place**:\n    - 3 (from 386392332) + 4 (from 491799586) + 1 (carried over) = 8\n    - Write down 8.\n\n11. **Final result**: After adding all the place values, we get the sum of 386392332 and 491799586.\n\n   ```\n   386392332\n   +491799586\n   ---------\n   878191918\n   ```\n']
